            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 1, height: 64, background: '#B5C7D8' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 5 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>左闭右开：10:30 结束的预约，与 10:30 开始的活动不重叠。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>把两个区间放到同一条时间轴上，看有没有交集——这是校验器要写死的规则。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.1 环境与第一次调用</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>09 / 24</Text>
